# Oracle: R59, A35 (legalize names each unnamed analysis by its kind's IR word and a count from
# 1 per word, each DC axis `axis<n>` in listed order, each loop `loop<n>`); VD cmd-sweep (a Dc is
# its axes as sweep lines, outermost first, then an op).
file "names_given.ir" deck
  title "names given"
  analysis op
  analysis tran stop=1m cap=span_over50
  loop sweep (temp) (list values=[0i])
    analysis ac (list values=[1k])
  analysis dc (device_param v2 dc) (list values=[0i, 1i]) (device_param v1 dc) (lin start=1i stop=3i step=0.5)
